     "title": "Practice: One Conversation About All This",
     "content": "Within the next week, have one conversation with a non-Psychology friend about what Psycho-Cybernetics actually says, what survives, and what doesn't. Aim for under 5 minutes. The conversation tests whether you can summarize coherently, distinguish supported from unsupported, and resist the pop-self-help drift. Teaching is the strongest test of understanding.",
