      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"bold\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n<rect x=\"150\" y=\"130\" width=\"800\" height=\"190\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#6366f1\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.1\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\">WHAT MAKES A SUGGESTION STICK</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"normal\">Repetition + emotion + no scrutiny</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\">Not authority, trance, or accuracy</text>\n<circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"480\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#6366f1\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.12\"/>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"484\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">REPEAT</text>\n<circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"480\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#ef4444\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.12\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"484\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">EMOTION</text>\n<circle cx=\"800\" cy=\"480\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.12\"/>\n<text x=\"800\" y=\"478\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\">NO</text>\n<text x=\"800\" y=\"498\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">SCRUTINY</text>\n</svg>",
      "caption": "Test your understanding of the suggestion mechanism"
